  "review": {
    "authenticity": "actual_marker_source_query supplies the actual same-tick publisher wire/key and earlier real MAC operation. actual_verification_origin_or_forgery retains the actual comparison Tick and classifies the accepted marker as a source-authenticated query or MAC-forgery candidate. observedTag extracts that candidate from supplied bytes, not verifier internals. Internal verification MAC calls are not signing queries. bad_sample_count_le transfers a pointwise finite sampled reduction; it assumes no zero-failure/no-forgery/injectivity axiom.",
    "backend": "Each recorded owned child event derives its earlier actual Source/ProcessJournal birth and exact spawn arguments. allocated=true means born/known, not running. The maintained controller Metadata.bounded adapter uses the real open/read/close ABI and O_RDONLY|O_CLOEXEC 524288. The controller runtime and fixed-argument VMM interfaces describe individual observed operations; complete filesystem footprint/lifetime production remains open.",
    "flags": "Handle.flags records original open/request provenance, not F_GETFL status. O_CREAT/O_EXCL/O_CLOEXEC cannot be inferred from F_GETFL. OFD positions/append are separate mutable state; closeExec and native nonblocking observations stay separately represented.",
    "global_authority": "GloballyHeld uses actual current actor references or current namespace bindings, never stale shared raw tables or historical child descriptor maps. Per-operation authority retention frames UID/type/low permission bits only. Ordinary foreign permitted changes remain; same-host verified peers derive safe setters from actual source. Backend actions stay separately recorded and require actual per-operation controller/VMM producers.",
    "key_lifetime": "A computational UF-CMA bound requires the complete actual publication-key lifetime transcript from fresh key generation, including earlier persisted reports across restarts, plus source-derived key nonexposure. A current-request journal alone does not justify that bound. Historical tags are not discarded or assumed forged. Finite device/inode envelope values likewise do not imply physical lifetime injectivity.",
    "metadata": "AuthoritySafeRequest restricts only a setter name. Every actual returned/lost Entrypoint setter is derived from real packet/CLI/run/validator/publication source to use one of the two exact tracked user.* names; actual_no_acl_setter excludes both POSIX ACL names. The primitive relation still permits arbitrary ACL setters, and only the actual application source supplies the narrower profile.",
    "namespace": "TrackedAttribute is exactly the private-anchor/publication user.* names. Attribute byte/existing/other laws require those names and an actual raw handle. The invalid raw-absence-implies-EBADF law was removed. syscall_keeps_marker now explicitly requires the selected setter raw-handle producer; global source custody must supply it.",
    "publication_borrow": "Actual authentication, bounded writes, descendant traversal, export iteration and preparation retain any preexisting stage raw FD/OFD, using fresh descriptor allocation and same-source close discipline. No whole prepare/fill frame is a premise.",
    "remaining": "Actual native channel producer instance; source-derived global family/capability/birth-to-open/resource fold; controller/QEMU per-child namespace footprint; exact historical key/marker persistence and key nonexposure; full key-lifetime cryptographic experiment reduction; compatible useful global execution and integrated public M5.2 acceptance.",
    "vm_borrow": "run_borrow proves the maintained spawn/descriptor/clock/connect/poll/read/consume/reap/run source retains each preexisting raw handle on arbitrary replies, errors and lost-call prefixes. Only the actual freshly allocated cancellation connection may close. loop_borrow_source is an rfl equality to the actual executable; source continuation copies are kernel-connected by definitional equality rather than a translation or helper-frame assumption. ActorPhysicalPrefix/actor_borrow_physical_prefix and actor_borrow_returns give the actual same-history interpretation with interference."
  },
